        "Virgo is the sixth sign from Aries, and the sixth place is about daily work, habits and health. So Virgo shows Aries what it usually skips: the ordinary routines that keep a bold plan alive. Aries, cardinal fire under Mars, returns the favour by getting mutable earth under Mercury to stop checking and start.",
